---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural Data Sources & Update Policy — GoOrganicAfrica
description: How GoOrganicAfrica monitors agricultural market prices, seed prices, input costs and official statistics for its farming tools.
permalink: "/data-updates/"
---
{% include "partials/language-selectors/static.njk" %}


<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.eyebrow">Data Transparency</span>
    <h1 data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.title">Agricultural Data Sources & Updates</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.intro">GoOrganicAfrica is designed to refresh agricultural reference data.</p>
    <div class="trust-strip" style="margin:28px 0;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);">
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="num">{{ site.calculator.countryCount }}</span><span class="label" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.active">Active countries</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="num">{{ site.calculator.enterpriseCount }}</span><span class="label" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.enterprises">Farming enterprises</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="num">{{ site.calculator.priceRecordCount }}</span><span class="label" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.records">Country price records</span></div>
    </div>
    <h2 data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto">What can be updated automatically?</h2>
    <ul class="benefit-list">
      <li data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto1">Commodity selling prices from reliable market or government datasets.</li>
      <li data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto2">Seed prices and supplier information where available.</li>
      <li data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto3">Livestock and animal market prices where trustworthy data is available.</li>
      <li data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto4">Fertilizer, feed, irrigation, labour and other input costs.</li>
      <li data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.auto5">Exchange-rate data.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.protect">How publishing is protected</h2>
    <p data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.protectText">Automated collection does not mean blindly replacing calculator values.</p>
    <h2 data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.registry">Current source registry</h2>
    {% if site.data.sources.length %}
    <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">
        <thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.publisher">Publisher</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.data">Data</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.country">Country</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.frequency">Frequency</th><th style="text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);" data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.status">Status</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{% for source in site.data.sources %}<tr><td style="padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">{{ source.publisher }}</td><td style="padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">{{ source.data_type }}</td><td style="padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">{{ source.country }}</td><td style="padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">{{ source.frequency }}</td><td style="padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">{{ source.status }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p style="margin-top:28px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;"><strong data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.latest">Latest calculator reference period detected:</strong> {{ site.calculator.latestAsOf }}. <span data-i18n="static.dataUpdates.verify">Always verify prices with local buyers, suppliers and current market conditions before investing.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>
